common-passwords.txt
====================

Source:  SecLists, Passwords/Common-Credentials/xato-net-10-million-passwords-100000.txt
         https://github.com/danielmiessler/SecLists (branch master, fetched 2026-11-02)
         sha256 of the upstream file:
         1472aafa2561df5e3293aee252aee3ca660c12b399a283cf808bb01b39be388b
Derived: CR stripped, entries shorter than 8 characters dropped (8 is the lowest allowed
         `auth.password.min_length`, so shorter entries are always rejected by length),
         ASCII-lowercased, sorted and deduplicated:
           tr -d '\r' < in | awk 'length($0)>=8' | LC_ALL=C tr 'A-Z' 'a-z' | LC_ALL=C sort -u
         Result: 38451 entries.
